# An impression of The Great Wave off Kanagawa by Hokusai (public domain), issue 076: a pale paper frame, a cream sky, a big dark blue wave curling over with white foam claws, a small snow-capped mountain behind and a distant boat. 32x16 wall slot.
size: 32x16
